{"name":"Vesper","hex":"#0011cc","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Vesper","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The planet Venus as the evening star."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname from German."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Vesper"}],"entries":[{"title":"Vesper, Kansas","blocks":[{"text":"Vesper is an unincorporated community in Lincoln County, Kansas, United States. It is located about 7 miles (11 km) west of Lincoln."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Map_of_Lincoln_Co%2C_Ks%2C_USA.png/330px-Map_of_Lincoln_Co%2C_Ks%2C_USA.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vesper%2C_Kansas","wikidata":"Q17108559"},{"title":"Vesper, Oregon","blocks":[{"text":"Vesper is an unincorporated community in Clatsop County, Oregon, United States. The Nehalem River flows through the town. Settled in 1876 by William Johnston, a man who would be responsible for the town's first post office and church, Vesper borders Jewell and the Columbia County line. Johnston also served as the town's first postmaster. Before 1901, Vesper was completely isolated from the rest of the county on land; for one to reach the community, it would have been necessary to travel via ferry on the Nehalem River. The county expanded wagon roads to the community, eventually leading to automobile roads being built in 1908. Nowadays, Oregon Route 202 passes through Vesper."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vesper%2C_Oregon","wikidata":"Q7923277"},{"title":"Vesper (cocktail)","blocks":[{"text":"The Vesper is a cocktail that was originally made of gin, vodka, and Kina Lillet. Since that form of Lillet is no longer produced, modern bartenders need to modify the recipe to mimic the original taste, with Lillet Blanc or Cocchi Americano as a typical substitute."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/The_Vesper.png/330px-The_Vesper.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vesper_(cocktail)","wikidata":"Q590793"},{"title":"Vesper (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Vesper is a 2022 science fiction film directed by Kristina Buožytė and Bruno Samper, starring Raffiella Chapman, Eddie Marsan, Rosy McEwen and Richard Brake. Set in a bleak post-apocalyptic Earth, it follows the eponymous 14-year-old girl skilled in biohacking. It was selected to compete at the 2022 Karlovy Vary International Film Festival."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/38/Vesper_film_poster.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vesper_(film)","wikidata":"Q112705638"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Oregon_Trees_Up_View.jpg/500px-Oregon_Trees_Up_View.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Oregon_Trees_Up_View.jpg/1280px-Oregon_Trees_Up_View.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Oregon_Trees_Up_View.jpg/500px-Oregon_Trees_Up_View.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOregon_Trees_Up_View.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Oregon_Farm_House_Pan.JPG/500px-Oregon_Farm_House_Pan.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Oregon_Farm_House_Pan.JPG/1280px-Oregon_Farm_House_Pan.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Oregon_Farm_House_Pan.JPG/500px-Oregon_Farm_House_Pan.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOregon_Farm_House_Pan.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Vesper%2C_Oregon_road_1919.png/330px-Vesper%2C_Oregon_road_1919.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Vesper%2C_Oregon_road_1919.png/330px-Vesper%2C_Oregon_road_1919.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVesper%2C_Oregon_road_1919.png"}],"sounds":{"Vesper":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-vesper.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-vesper.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-vesper.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-vesper.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-vesper.wav.ogg"}]}}}